{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":30768701,"name":"Kaivax","username":"Kaivax","avatar_template":"/en/wow/user_avatar/us.forums.blizzard.com/kaivax/{size}/948_2.png","created_at":"2026-11-05T15:42:52.385Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eIn this thread, we will discuss issues that the WoW Forever team have determined to be notable, impactful, and already tracked with plans to fix in the future. This is not a comprehensive list of issues, and it will be updated regularly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-30768701-known-issues-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-30768701-known-issues-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eKnown Issues\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDungeons\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn Razorfen Kraul, there’s a cauldron near Roogug that players can fall into and get stuck.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGamepad\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAn error may be generated when attempting to delete more than 1 rare or epic item.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstructions for the push-to-talk keyboard button may be unintentionally displayed when joining a voice channel.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNPCs\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePvP Vendors are temporarily unavailable in all locations (Orgrimmar, Stormwind, and Dalaran).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStormwind guards incorrectly direct players to Fyrenz Stagazer for Transmogrification. The correct name of the NPC is Fyrenz Vishonar.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuests\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cs\u003e“Vorsha the Lasher” in Ashenvale has been disabled until a bug causing a crash can be fixed.\u003c/s\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser Interface\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\